<#50ff78>FLAME GAUGE</>
Flame (gauge full)		^X
  Hits fill the green flame gauge (bottom of the screen);
  specials and supers fill it most. At full, X from neutral
  (or on contact with a normal) lights the flames for 10
  seconds: normals do +20% damage, specials and supers +40%.
  The gauge is empty afterwards and does not fill meanwhile.

<#50ff78>SYSTEM</>
Parry		^Z
  Catches any attack. A whiff costs 80 meter.
Grab		^Y
  Ground only.
Burst (while being hit)		^A_+^B_+^C
  Invincible, no damage, hard knockdown. 75 second cooldown.
  Refills faster once a combo on him passes 15% of his life.
Dash		_F_F
Back Step		_B_B
High Jump		_D_U
Zero Counter (while guarding, 1 bar)		_B_DB_D^A / ^B / ^C

<#50ff78>NORMALS</>
Light (punch)		^A
Medium (kick)		^B
Heavy (kick)		^C
Floreal (back kick)		_B^B / _B^C
Crouching Light / Medium / Heavy		_D^A / _D^B / _D^C
Air Light / Medium / Heavy		^A / ^B / ^C
Chain (ground and air)		^A > ^B > ^C
  On hit or block, upward only. Any connected ground normal
  cancels into specials, EX moves and supers.

<#50ff78>SPECIALS</>
Ventose		_B_F (charge)^A
Germinal Caprice		_B_F (charge)^B
Nivose		_D_U (charge)^B
Genie		_D_DB_B^A / ^B

<#50ff78>EX MOVES (500 meter)</>
EX Ventose		_B_F (charge)^C
EX Nivose		_D_U (charge)^C
EX Genie		_D_DB_B^C

<#50ff78>SUPERS (1 bar)</>
Thermidor		_D_DF_F_D_DF_F^A / ^B
Pluviose		_D_DB_B_D_DB_B^A / ^B

<#50ff78>SUPERS (2 bars)</>
MAX Thermidor		_D_DF_F_D_DF_F^C
MAX Pluviose		_D_DB_B_D_DB_B^C

<#50ff78>SUPER (5 bars)</>
Espoir		_D_DB_B_B_DB_D_DF_F^C
